      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NINA SIYAN (1) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Grade 3/4 three back before a placing at this track the following run. Key player on best and worth another chance. KAIRANGA STORM (4) is a progressive type who recorded his 3rd career win last time out (16.85) at this track. Sure to measure up. ALTONA BEACH (2) struggled in tougher grade last start after being shuffled back early at this track, but prior to that won by half a length at this track (16.66) beating Non Stop Whiskey in a Grade 5 on July 20. Won at her only start from this draw. Can measure up this time. SPEEDY BEN (8) is a last-start placegetter and was in front for a fair way - in the mix again.",
